NET YIELD (= confirmed leaks per SAMPLE) folds in the realization cost of fence-sparse mit=leak gadgets. Positive net-yield gap vs the neutral baseline (unknown) with non-overlapping CIs = leak-conditioning earns its place in the discovery loop: more real attacks per oracle call. leak_rate(adj) is the per-adjudicable rate (the 5b headline). Low adjudicable counts = Spectector couldn't model many gadgets.

